# Build-context hygiene. Without this the ENTIRE working tree is uploaded to
# the Docker daemon — node_modules, stress reports, Playwright artifacts and
# all — which is slow locally and wasteful in CI.

# Dependencies: reinstalled inside the image (and host binaries are the wrong
# platform anyway).
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build artifacts: regenerated by `npm run compile` / `npm run build` in the
# image. Excluding them also stops a stale host dist/ from silently shipping.
packages/*/dist
.evershop

# VCS and hooks. .git must stay out (HUSKY=0 in the Dockerfile covers the
# prepare hook that would otherwise fail without it).
.git
.gitignore
.husky
.github

# Local environment and logs
.env
.env.*
*.log

# Test, benchmark and report output
tests
playwright-report
test-results
stress-report-*
jmeter.log

# Repo documentation and working material — not part of the runtime image.
wiki
docs
specifications
design-kit
CLAUDE.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md

# Local one-off scripts
seed-*.mjs
verify-*.mjs
